<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Вход - Kanban</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        .auth-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .auth-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            text-align: center;
        }
        body.light .auth-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }
        body.dark .auth-card {
            background: rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }
        .auth-card h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .auth-card p {
            opacity: 0.7;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .auth-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            color: inherit;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        body.light .auth-input {
            background: white;
            border-color: #e5e7eb;
        }
        body.dark .auth-input {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        .auth-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #a78bfa;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.3);
        }
        .auth-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6 0%, #a78bfa 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        .auth-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
        }
        .auth-link {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .auth-link a {
            color: #a78bfa;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .auth-link a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .error-msg {
            color: #ef4444;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: -8px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-container">
        <div class="auth-card">
            <h1>🔐 Вход в систему</h1>
            <p>Войдите в свою учётную запись</p>
            
            <input type="email" id="loginEmail" class="auth-input" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email">
            <input type="password" id="loginPassword" class="auth-input" placeholder="Пароль" autocomplete="current-password">
            <div id="loginError" class="error-msg"></div>
            
            <button class="auth-btn" onclick="handleLogin()">Войти</button>
            
            <div class="auth-link">
                Нет аккаунта? <a href="register.html">Зарегистрироваться</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="config.js"></script>
    <!-- <script src="auth.js"></script> -->
</body>
</html>